    "faq": {
      "type": "home-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it legal?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we utilized federally legal hemp and lion's mane mushroom to create something special. The Delta-9 THC in our drinks is naturally-derived from hemp (Cannabis sativa L.) and is no more than 0.3% of the product's net weight, ensuring full compliance with the 2018 Farm Bill.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I get anxious or paranoid?",
            "answer": "<p>Highly unlikely—due to our unique addition of Lion's Mane extract, our microdosed approach to THC, and our rapid-absorption micronization process, we've created what we see as the solution to the bad edible trip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does it feel like?",
            "answer": "<p>Most first feel a quick, energizing, happy euphoria followed by a sense of relief and relaxation. Unlike traditional edibles, we utilize fast-acting micronized extracts that are felt within 5 minutes and last up to 1.5 hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does microdosed mean?",
            "answer": "<p>We use just the right amount in each can to help you feel elevated and happy without overwhelming. This also means you have full control over how many you decide to consume, creating the experience perfect for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do you ship?",
            "answer": "<p>We currently ship across the continental US - enter your shipping address in checkout to verify!</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! All of our products have been third-party tested in registered facilities with GMP certifications. You can also find our lab certificates for each batch from the link in the footer.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_1",
        "question_2",
        "question_3",
        "question_4",
        "question_5",
        "question_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Cannabis + Mushrooms",
